&lt;p&gt;commit 0893dbac3409248c0638f0bd259ac088c279e09c&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Garus Denis &amp;lt;garus.d.g@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2018-05-23T12:17:24Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8183&quot; title=&quot;ZookeeperDiscoverySpiTest#testSegmentation3 fails on TC and locally&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8183&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8183&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; run test 50 times&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16495099" author="garus.d.g" created="Wed, 30 May 2018 12:30:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt; The investigation of this ticket shows, that if we increase the timeout on latch then the test becomes green. Could I know why the timeout is 20 second? How was this value calculated? &lt;br/&gt;
Thank.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16496645" author="garus.d.g" created="Thu, 31 May 2018 14:40:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;d like to suggest to calculate the timeout on latch as sum of (ms):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;QuorumPeer.getTickTime() * qp.getInitLimit() - timeout on socket inside Zookeeper&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;sesTimeout - delay on ZookeeperClient&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;5 * 1000 - other logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;What do you think?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16500063" author="sergey-chugunov" created="Mon, 4 Jun 2018 10:58:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=garus.d.g&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;garus.d.g&quot;&gt;garus.d.g&lt;/a&gt;, thanks for your patch!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your analysis seems correct to me. It looks like that the source of the original timeout of 20 seconds could be value of syncLimit which is always configured to 5 in testing cluster.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However I don&apos;t think we should add up sesTimeout on ZookeeperClient side, sum of tickTime * initLimit + otherLogic should be enough here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also I left a comment in your PR, please address it and we will be good to proceed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16501949" author="garus.d.g" created="Tue, 5 Jun 2018 15:26:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;ve made the fix in the PR. Creating constant is inconvenient because of the timeout calculates on Zookeeper&apos;s config base. &lt;br/&gt;
Could you do the review?&lt;br/&gt;
Thank!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16503395" author="sergey-chugunov" created="Wed, 6 Jun 2018 14:37:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=garus.d.g&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;garus.d.g&quot;&gt;garus.d.g&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now change seems good to me, please fix minor typo in java comment (&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;tickTime * initLimit&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; should be instead of &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;tickTime + initLimit&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) and proceed with merging.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16503410" author="garus.d.g" created="Wed, 6 Jun 2018 14:56:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt;, done. Thank.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
